  "contentHtml": "\n<p><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120316010008im_/http://blog.banjig.net/files/user_uploads/226598/zos5nt900129-02_2d3e439a.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><p>Та \nбүхэнд би нэгэн сонирхолтой зураг хүргэж байна. Энэхүү зургуудыг \nанагаахын музейгээс авсан юм. Энэхүү мэдээг хүргэхэд тусалсан энэхүү \nзургийг авсан охинд баярлалаа гэж хэлмээр байна.</p><p><!--break--><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120316010008im_/http://blog.banjig.net/files/user_uploads/226598/5gdvnb453584-02_a803445d.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120316010008im_/http://blog.banjig.net/files/user_uploads/226598/7jurmo158426-02_fce91962.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120316010008im_/http://blog.banjig.net/files/user_uploads/226598/91pupe772793-02_f74bd003.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120316010008im_/http://blog.banjig.net/files/user_uploads/226598/aga15h902200-02_1e1751da.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120316010008im_/http://blog.banjig.net/files/user_uploads/226598/bz4bvx761364-02_f27228ff.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120316010008im_/http://blog.banjig.net/files/user_uploads/226598/d6.fge408815-02_f9a1998f.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120316010008im_/http://blog.banjig.net/files/user_uploads/226598/feslif424650-02_1a639a27.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120316010008im_/http://blog.banjig.net/files/user_uploads/226598/f2anog681243-02_72adec33.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120316010008im_/http://blog.banjig.net/files/user_uploads/226598/fqyz6x006360-02_